 <h3><u>Zehra s.a ke haath me</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Sayeda, Tahera..(8)</p> 
  <p>kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra ke hath me..(2)<br> sher e khuda ka haath hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Allah ne mangali sare arsh rotiyan..(2)<br> koi to aaisi baat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Jis dar se chal raha hai Zamane ka har nizam..(2)<br> us ki ma'ashiat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Beti ko sath laae hai is waste rasool..(2)<br> najraniyon ki maat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Malik hai jaise chahe yeh tabdiliyan kare..(2)<br> lau ho kalam dawaat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Kehne lage hussain yeh rumaal band kar..(2)<br> jaa hur teri najaat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>6.Hathon me hath shabbar o shabbir&nbsp; ke nahi..(2)<br> islam ki hayaat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Kaise mitae koi aza ki nishaniyan ..(2)<br> hifz e tabarrukat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Tasbihe fatema&nbsp; ne takallum bata diya<br> har radd e mushkilat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me<br> kul nazm e qaiyanat hai Zehra&nbsp; ke hath me..(2)</p> 
  <p>sayeda, tahera ..(2)</p> 
